\ @ID 11
\ @TITLE BRONZE PULSE
\ @SUBTITLE 10.23.53 · DYADIC ACCELERATING PULSE
\ @CATEGORY MATH-SYNTH
\ @PARTS 3
\ @PART 1 Kick Pulse
\ @PART 2 + Polymetric Bass
\ @PART 3 + Dyadic Pulse
\ @SPEED 1.9
\ @FORMULA y1=2.1e^(-18(x mod 4))-0.5, y3=1.3-4*frac(2^(floor(x/4)+1)*(x-1))/2^(floor(x/4)+1)

VARIABLE BP-X  VARIABLE BP-Y1  VARIABLE BP-Y2  VARIABLE BP-Y3  VARIABLE BP-PW

: TRACK-EVAL ( x part -- )
  SWAP DUP BP-X !
  DUP 4.0 MOD DUP 1.0 < IF -18.0 * EXP 2.1 * 0.5 - ELSE DROP QUIET THEN BP-Y1 !

  DUP 4.0 * DUP FRAC SWAP FLOOR >INT 32 +
  DUP 3 I* F16 8.0 / FRAC 0.625 < IF
    5 IMOD DUP 1 + I* 2 I/ F16 SWAP -5.0 * EXP *
    13.0 SWAP - 18.0 - 12.0 / BP-X @ 0.0 MAX 8.0 / +
  ELSE 2DROP QUIET THEN BP-Y2 !

  DUP 4.0 / FLOOR 1.0 + POW2 DUP BP-PW !
  SWAP 1.0 - * FRAC DUP 0.5 < OVER BP-PW @ / 0.1875 < AND IF
    4.0 * BP-PW @ / 1.3 SWAP -
  ELSE DROP QUIET THEN BP-Y3 !

  CASE
    0 OF 1 VOICES-N! BP-Y1 @ 0 PRIM-SINE ENDOF
    1 OF 2 VOICES-N! BP-Y1 @ 0 PRIM-SINE  BP-Y2 @ 1 PRIM-TRI ENDOF
    3 VOICES-N! BP-Y1 @ 0 PRIM-SINE  BP-Y2 @ 1 PRIM-TRI  BP-Y3 @ 2 PRIM-PLS
  ENDCASE ;
